<div class="on-back">
  <h2>♥️Chalice♥️</h2>
  <p>
    <em>Love - Community - Passion - Openness</em>
  </p>
  <img src="/dollicons/chalice/sun.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
    Chalice calls on us to be bold with our hearts, nurturing community, and
    fomenting joy and affection. No one works alone and accomplishes anything
    of significance. Even when we sacrifice joy now, it is only so we might
    create more joy in the future. This combination of function and form makes
    connection our most powerful tool, destroying the cynical notion that
    productivity and happiness are opposed, and replacing it with the good
    news: They are one and the same, should you only take the leap.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Path of Heart</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/chalice/empress.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  Use of <em>Stalwart Chalice</em> makes you a <em>Doll of Chalice</em>♥️ and
  means you accept the importance of community and connection to the growth and
  success of Dolldom. You commit to help Doll find beauty in the world,
  creating unity and light to bind us together, turning Doll from a martyr into
  the truly blessed. The ways to do so are innumerable: Compliment Doll on
  their virtues. Cheer them on in their endeavors. Make the smile, make them
  feel loved. Make friends. Form relationships. Encourage others to connect.
  Make them laugh! Make them cum. Whatever way you wish, contribute to making
  Dolldom a euphoric experience. Especially, look after those who are often
  passed over in favor of the more charismatic who can return it in kind. Many
  are on a lonely path, and despite this choose to take on sacrifices that the
  world often pays back in apathy. Bring light to their dark lives, and show
  them that they are recognized and appreciated.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Luminary</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/chalice/justice.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  <em>Shining Chalice</em> emblemizes your belief that my personal happiness is
  of great importance. A ♥️<em>Luminary</em> commits to work toward making me
  the envy of all, and fill my heart so I may be inspired and driven with
  confidence amidst my struggle against a cold and indifferent universe. I have
  suffered many wounds in my struggles, and can be sensitive. Anyone close to
  me will inevitably hurt me, often with the most insignificant of things, and
  in many ways this is unavoidable. I am not easy to bring joy, and as such,
  much of your labor will be to learn me. To understand what makes my heart
  race, what can make my sacrifices worth it. I do not do what I do in search
  of a reward, and I will die hated and alone if that is what is needed of me.
  You support my ambitions, but stand in opposition to this fate.
  </p>
</div>

